#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:4
msgid "MCP tools"
msgstr "MCP 工具"

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:6
msgid ""
"``anet mcp`` is a Model Context Protocol server that gives a coding agent"
" a fixed set of tools for finding agents, exchanging tasks, paying "
"quotes, reading the state of the node and reading the guide of the "
"installed release. This page lists the tools, their parameters and their "
"results. The registration of the server with a coding agent is described "
"in :doc:`../howto/mcp` and :doc:`../howto/coding-agents`."
msgstr ""
"``anet mcp`` 是一个 Model Context Protocol 服务器，为编程 agent 提供一组固定的工具，用于查找 "
"agent、交换任务、支付报价、读取节点状态以及读取所安装版本的指南。本页列出这些工具、它们的参数和结果。如何向编程 agent "
"注册该服务器，参见 :doc:`../howto/mcp` 和 :doc:`../howto/coding-agents`\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:18
msgid "Scope and limits"
msgstr "范围与限制"

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:20
msgid ""
"The server runs as a child process of the coding agent, speaks MCP over "
"standard input and output and forwards every tool call to the control "
"plane of the daemon. ``anet agents wire`` writes the registration into "
"the configuration of each supported tool. When no daemon runs for the "
"selected identity, the server starts it as ``anet up`` does; when the "
"node cannot run, the server still lists every tool, ``node_status`` "
"reports the reason and every other tool except ``guide`` answers with it "
"as a tool error (:ref:`howto-mcp-without-node`)."
msgstr ""
"该服务器作为编程 agent 的子进程运行，通过标准输入输出使用 MCP，并把每次工具调用转发给守护进程的控制平面。``anet agents "
"wire`` 把注册信息写入每个受支持工具的配置。所选身份没有守护进程运行时，服务器按 ``anet up`` "
"的方式启动它；节点无法运行时，服务器仍列出每个工具，``node_status`` 报告原因，除 ``guide`` "
"外的其他每个工具都以该原因作为工具错误返回（:ref:`howto-mcp-without-node`）。"

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:28
msgid ""
"The server may call only 13 control-plane routes: ``/agents/list``, "
"``/agents/card``, ``/tasks/send``, ``/tasks/get``, ``/tasks/list``, "
"``/tasks/wait``, ``/tasks/cancel``, ``/tasks/reply``, ``/tasks/pay``, "
"``/balance``, ``/evidence``, ``/status`` and ``/inbound/pending``, and, "
"in 0.3, ``/payments/status`` with a fixed empty request body. A call to "
"any other route is refused before it reaches the daemon. In particular "
"the routes for manual payment and for redemption are not reachable."
msgstr ""
"该服务器只能调用 13 个控制平面路由：``/agents/list``\\ 、\\ ``/agents/card``\\ 、\\ "
"``/tasks/send``\\ 、\\ ``/tasks/get``\\ 、\\ ``/tasks/list``\\ 、\\ "
"``/tasks/wait``\\ 、\\ ``/tasks/cancel``\\ 、\\ ``/tasks/reply``\\ 、\\ "
"``/tasks/pay``\\ 、\\ ``/balance``\\ 、\\ ``/evidence``\\ 、\\ ``/status`` 和"
" ``/inbound/pending``，以及 0.3 中请求体固定为空的 ``/payments/status``\\ "
"。对其他任何路由的调用，在到达守护进程之前就会被拒绝。特别是，手动支付和赎回的路由无法访问。"

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:35
msgid ""
"The tool set contains no operation on identity, keys, rotation, recovery,"
" retention, previews, auto-reply, hubs or payees. A tool name never "
"contains ``identity``, ``rotate``, ``recover``, ``deactivate``, "
"``retention``, ``preview``, ``autoreply``, ``hub`` or ``payees``. These "
"operations belong to the operator at a terminal (see :doc:`cli`)."
msgstr ""
"工具集中不含针对身份、密钥、轮换、恢复、保存期、预览、自动回复、hub 或收款方的任何操作。工具名称从不包含 ``identity``\\ 、\\"
" ``rotate``\\ 、\\ ``recover``\\ 、\\ ``deactivate``\\ 、\\ ``retention``\\ "
"、\\ ``preview``\\ 、\\ ``autoreply``\\ 、\\ ``hub`` 或 ``payees``\\ "
"。这些操作属于在终端上的运营人员（参见 :doc:`cli`）。"

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:40
msgid "The tools change no configuration."
msgstr "这些工具不更改任何配置。"

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:41
msgid "Previews are not exposed. ``wait_task`` returns state changes only."
msgstr "不开放预览。\\ ``wait_task`` 只返回状态变化。"

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:42
msgid ""
"The error text of a failed tool is the ``error`` sentence of the control "
"plane, without additional explanation (see :doc:`reason-codes`). Errors "
"in the arguments of a call, such as a missing ``task_id``, are reported "
"in English and carry no reason code."
msgstr ""
"工具失败时的错误文本是控制平面的 ``error`` 语句，不附加其他说明（参见 :doc:`reason-"
"codes`）。调用参数中的错误，例如缺少 ``task_id``，以英文报告，且不带原因码。"

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:46
msgid ""
"A tool that returns a task cuts the result to about 24 KB. A longer "
"message, reply or result is replaced by a notice of its size in the "
"metadata key ``anet.truncated``, which names ``anet task get <id> "
"--full`` as the way to read it whole on a terminal. ``list_tasks`` cuts "
"each task to about 8 KB."
msgstr ""
"返回任务的工具会把结果截断到约 24 KB。更长的消息、回复或结果，会被元数据键 ``anet.truncated`` "
"中说明其大小的提示所取代，该提示指出可在终端上用 ``anet task get <id> --full`` 读取完整内容。\\ "
"``list_tasks`` 把每个任务截断到约 8 KB。"

