#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:128
msgid ""
"Tools that return a task return an A2A task: ``status.state``, "
"``history``, ``artifacts`` and ``metadata``. Two statements apply to "
"every such result."
msgstr ""
"返回任务的工具返回一个 A2A 任务：``status.state``\\ 、\\ ``history``\\ 、\\ ``artifacts``"
" 和 ``metadata``\\ 。以下两点适用于每个这样的结果。"

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:131
msgid ""
"The state ``TASK_STATE_COMPLETED`` means that the other side finished. "
"When ``anet.effect_status`` is ``UNVERIFIED``, the capability ran and its"
" effect cannot be proven; this is not a success. "
"``anet.receipt_verified`` is ``verified``, ``unverified`` (the receipt "
"could not be checked, which does not mean forged), ``unknown`` or "
"``mismatch`` (the signed conversation changes what the requester said)."
msgstr ""
"状态 ``TASK_STATE_COMPLETED`` 表示对方已完成。\\ ``anet.effect_status`` 为 "
"``UNVERIFIED`` 时，能力已运行，但其效果无法证明；这不算成功。\\ ``anet.receipt_verified`` 取 "
"``verified``\\ 、\\ ``unverified``\\ （回执无法检查，并不意味着伪造）、\\ ``unknown`` 或 "
"``mismatch``\\ （已签名的对话改变了请求方所说的内容）。"

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:137
msgid ""
"The state ``TASK_STATE_FAILED`` with ``anet.effect_status`` "
"``UNVERIFIED`` and an ``anet.reason`` of ``timeout``, ``connection_lost``"
" or ``interrupted`` means that the call was sent and that it is not known"
" whether it took effect. The call must not be sent again as if it had not"
" run."
msgstr ""
"状态 ``TASK_STATE_FAILED``，且 ``anet.effect_status`` 为 ``UNVERIFIED``\\ 、\\ "
"``anet.reason`` 为 ``timeout``\\ 、\\ ``connection_lost`` 或 "
"``interrupted``，表示调用已发出，但不知道是否已产生效果。不得把该调用当作未运行过而重新发送。"

#: ../../reference/mcp-tools.rst:142
msgid ""
"The task metadata of the 0.3 projection also holds ``anet.delivery`` "
"(``pending`` or ``unconfirmed`` while a message waits), "
"``anet.delivery_detail``, ``anet.delivery_wait``, ``anet.payment_note``, "
"``anet.spend_check``, ``anet.content_expires_at`` (the time at which the "
"node deletes the content of an ended task), ``anet.deduplicated`` and, "
"for a node whose recovery passphrase is not set, ``anet.identity_note``. "
"Beside ``anet.delivery``, three keys state when the message was queued "
"(``anet.delivery_since``), when the task gives up on it "
"(``anet.delivery_ends_at``, only while it is pending) and whether it "
"waits for the message before it (``anet.delivery_ordered``, only when "
"true). A completed task carries ``anet.receipt``, an object with the "
"signed receipt (``receipt``, base64), ``verified``, and the decoded "
"members ``provider_aid``, ``request_cid``, ``result_cid``, "
"``completed_day`` and ``receipt_cid``, and ``provider_kel`` when it is "
"known. The receipt names neither the requester nor the interaction. The "
"sentences are those of :doc:`reason-codes`."
msgstr ""
"0.3 投影的任务元数据还包含 ``anet.delivery``\\ （消息等待期间为 ``pending`` 或 "
"``unconfirmed``）、``anet.delivery_detail``、``anet.delivery_wait``、``anet.payment_note``、``anet.spend_check``、``anet.content_expires_at``\\"
" （节点删除已结束任务内容的时间）、``anet.deduplicated``，以及未设置恢复口令的节点上的 "
"``anet.identity_note``。除 ``anet.delivery`` "
"之外，另有三个键：消息入队的时间（``anet.delivery_since``）、任务放弃该消息的时间（``anet.delivery_ends_at``，仅在等待期间出现）、以及它是否要等前一条消息（``anet.delivery_ordered``，仅为"
" true 时出现）。已完成的任务带有 "
"``anet.receipt``，这是一个对象，含已签名的回执（``receipt``，base64）、``verified``，以及解码后的成员"
" ``provider_aid``、``request_cid``、``result_cid``、``completed_day`` 与 "
"``receipt_cid``，已知时还有 ``provider_kel``。回执既不指明请求方，也不指明交互。句子取自 :doc"
":`reason-codes`\\ 。"

